{"frame":"event","cursor":496,"box":"place-4fff6ea7","box_id":14,"session":14,"kind":"agent_said","payload":{"text":"Shellcheck 0.10.0 found one issue in the four shell scripts under `scripts/`, and I changed none of them.\n\n**`scripts/moor-setup.sh:126`, SC2086 (info):** double quote to prevent globbing and word splitting. The unquoted `$all` is deliberate, since it splits the step list into arguments.\n\n`check-android.sh`, `check-ios.sh` and `check-stack.sh` came back clean.\n\nThe work Box had no shellcheck, so I installed it there and closed the Box after. Setup line:\n```sh\npip install --user shellcheck-py\n```"},"ts":1795771389537}
